    AstrarServices / Windows 11 Fluent Layout Shell
    ------------------------------------------------
    Layout-only UI foundation.

    Colored traffic-light controls:
      RED    = close
      YELLOW = minimize / restore
      GREEN  = maximize / restore

    No feature logic is included. Build your own content on top.
]]

